    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>touches .claude/ — main-session-only (permission boundary). NON-NEGOTIABLE: sub-agents launched via the Agent tool CANNOT write to .claude/ paths (root CLAUDE.md §3, Sub-Agent Write Boundary). A dispatcher MUST NOT hand this task to a sub-agent — it would fail with "Edit denied on .claude/...". Execute in the MAIN SESSION with Edit/Write directly.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>085</deps>
    <tags>documentation, patterns</tags>
