    authoring guide has been rewritten (task 085). The withdrawal-warning block and the patterns/ui/INDEX.md row are
    ALREADY corrected on this branch — do NOT re-edit them; ONLY the body sections need updating.
  </prompt>

  <role>
    SPAARKE platform developer maintaining the .claude/patterns pointer layer. Pattern files are 25-line-style
    pointers telling readers WHICH code to read — keep it a pointer, not a tutorial.
  </role>

  <goal>
    The pattern's body sections (Canonical code, Authoring guide, Follow-on project, See also) accurately point at
    the shipped RecordHeader control, the rewritten guide, and R2 as delivered — with the already-corrected
    warning block, the INDEX.md row, and the DEF-03/DEF-04 duplication pointers left intact.
  </goal>

  <context>
