    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md §3">This task writes to a .claude/ path. It MUST run in the MAIN SESSION — never dispatched to a sub-agent. If an executor receives "Edit denied" on this file, that is the write boundary working: hand the edit back to the main session rather than retrying or working around it.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Edit ONLY the body sections of record-header-composition.md. Do NOT re-edit the ⚠️ withdrawal-warning block or .claude/patterns/ui/INDEX.md — both are already corrected on this branch. Do NOT touch any other .claude/ file.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">PRESERVE the "Duplication pointers" section (DEF-03 CardChrome, DEF-04 MemoSection) — both deferrals remain live and out of R2 scope. Update only their surrounding context if it names retired artifacts.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Keep it a POINTER: paths + one-line whys. The configuration tutorial lives in the rewritten guide; do not duplicate guide content here.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
